  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 4.2% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $281.62B (4.2% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-11-06-nigerias-central-bank-introduces-stablecoin-licensing-rules-bans-algorithmic-versions-435867\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nigeria\u2019s central bank introduces stablecoin licensing rules, bans algorithmic versions</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/regulation/france-s-budget-rejection-shelves-stablecoin-tax-and-wallet-reporting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">France\u2019s Budget Rejection Shelves Stablecoin Tax and Wallet Reporting</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/hacks/binance-expands-proof-of-reserves-to-44-tokens-after-hack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Binance Expands Proof of Reserves to 44 Tokens After Hack</a> (The Defiant).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
